*.pyc

# Windowsの付加ファイル
# ADS は "name:Zone.Identifier" という形で届くため、拡張子パターンだけでは
# 一致しない（実測: command.log:Zone.Identifier が追跡されたままだった）
*.Zone.Identifier
*:Zone.Identifier

# The actor links every tree in practice_ws/trees into cm1/trees when it starts
# (cm1/app_main.py runs make_symbolic_link), so a tree that is not committed
# shows up here as an untracked symlink nobody created by hand. ccc2 is created
# on demand that way; the links that belong to the repo stay tracked.
/pytwb_ws/src/cm1/cm1/trees/ccc2.xml
